p on thinking about it know your  own physical limitations  remember you have to see identify  and react this takes time  keep alert look  keep alive look  remember that today's and tomorrow's  aircraft  are the aircraft of the thinking and  looking man  so think and look stay  alert and then keep on looking  [Music]

